      "title": "How Each Case Reads Its Data",
      "items": [
        "B: VR wasSavings = Σ (orig−now requests) × max(current, baseline price) · WAS summary shows orig→now (CPU −78%, RAM −64% on f8dd5b4f) · classic savings 400 “read-only” = node track OFF · baseline-params 404 = none needed",
        "C/D: baseline-params 200 gives CLUSTER_HISTORY window, factors, unit costs; node savings = Σ (projected − actual) from baselinePeriodEndTime",
        "A/F: VR returns empty items — report “no data”, never $0 · nodes probe (GET) shows 0% provisioner.cast.ai/managed-by labels"
      ]
