      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Single Source of Truth",
      "items": [
        "Board numbers come from the value-realization report only",
        "Classic savings ≠ value-realization: kronos 30d reads $3,453 vs $7,702 — never mix both",
        "Dedupe by clusterId, never by name (six clusters are named “k8s”)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Double-Count Guard",
      "items": [
        "totalSavings == autoscalerSavings (node track) — verified exactly on live data",
        "workloadAutoscalerSavings is explanatory — already priced into the projection",
        "Wrong sum would read $159,007.68 vs true $150,024.33 for the org month"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Auth & Signal Quirks",
      "items": [
        "Every call needs X-API-Key + X-CastAI-Organization-Id — without it the fleet reads as zero clusters",
        "Karpenter integration: 0% managed-by labels yet node savings exist (andreas) — the flag beats the label",
        "WAS-enable date: first timeline month with WAS $ > 0 (metrics API holds ~7 days only)"
      ]
    }
